.703" end="1:01.396" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.703" end="55.040">才</span><span begin="55.040" end="55.566">想起</span><span begin="55.566" end="56.077">若</span><span begin="56.077" end="56.507">你</span><span begin="56.593" end="57.096">有</span><span begin="57.096" end="57.485">泪</span> <span begin="57.577" end="58.361">该</span><span begin="58.361" end="58.608">如</span><span begin="58.608" end="59.614">何安</span><span begin="59.614" end="1:01.396">置</span></p></div><div begin="1:03.518" end="1:35.009" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:03.518" end="1:18.592" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.518" end="1:03.976">就</span><span begin="1:03.976" end="1:06.040">借你</span><span begin="1:06.040" end="1:07.866">我耳</span><span begin="1:07.866" end="1:09.803">朵</span> <span begin="1:11.657" end="1:12.207">再</span><span begin="1:12.207" end="1:14.228">借你</span><span begin="1:14.228" end="1:16.069">我沉</span><span begin="1:16.069" end="1:18.592">默</span></p><p begin="1:19.761" end="1:35.009" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.761" end="1:20.467">像</span><span begin="1:20.467" end="1:22.499">你为</span><span begin="1:22.499" end="1:24.263">我那</span><span begin="1:24.263" end="1:27.556">样</span> <span begin="1:28.095" end="1:28.622">给</span><span begin="1:28.622" end="1:30.703">秘密</span><span begin="1:30.703" end="1:32.515">个下</span><span begin="1:32.515" end="1:35.009">落</span></p></div><div begin="1:41.168" end="1:58.120" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:41.168" end="1:44.638" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.168" end="1:41.412">我</span><span begin="1:41.412" end="1:41.961">听过</span><span begin="1:41.961" end="1:42.466">花如</span><span begin="1:42.466" end="1:42.722">何</span><span begin="1:42.722" end="1:43.143">爱</span><span begin="1:43.143" end="1:43.605">上</span><span begin="1:43.761" end="1:44.204">了</span><span begin="1:44.204" end="1:44.638">刺</span></p><p begin="1:44.707" end="1:49.218" itunes:key="L10" ttm:ag